{"signature": "{\"text\": \"Let us work through a hydroelectric energy-transfer example. Water in a high reservoir has a gravitational potential energy store. As it descends, this store decreases and the kinetic energy of the flowing water increases. The moving water does mechanical work on a turbine, and the generator transfers energy electrically to the grid. Some energy is dissipated to the surroundings because of friction and other losses.\", \"voice\": \"en-NG-AbeoNeural\", \"rate\": \"-4%\", \"eleven\": false}", "duration": 26.616, "words": [["Let", 0.102083], ["us", 0.3625], ["work", 0.557833], ["through", 0.83125], ["a", 1.026583], ["hydroelectric", 1.13075], ["energy-transfer", 1.964083], ["example.", 2.70625], ["Water", 4.21875], ["in", 4.596375], ["a", 4.700541], ["high", 4.804708], ["reservoir", 5.078125], ["has", 5.520833], ["a", 5.76825], ["gravitational", 5.885416], ["potential", 6.601583], ["energy", 7.1745], ["store.", 7.578125], ["As", 8.841166], ["it", 9.088541], ["descends,", 9.21875], ["this", 10.065125], ["store", 10.221375], ["decreases", 10.45575], ["and", 10.950541], ["the", 11.106791], ["kinetic", 11.223958], ["energy", 11.71875], ["of", 12.135416], ["the", 12.278666], ["flowing", 12.369791], ["water", 12.7995], ["increases.", 13.085958], ["The", 14.765625], ["moving", 14.947916], ["water", 15.325541], ["does", 15.625], ["mechanical", 15.833333], ["work", 16.39325], ["on", 16.653666], ["a", 16.770833], ["turbine,", 16.914083], ["and", 17.64325], ["the", 17.786458], ["generator", 17.903666], ["transfers", 18.398458], ["energy", 18.932291], ["electrically", 19.296875], ["to", 19.934916], ["the", 20.078125], ["grid.", 20.208333], ["Some", 21.484375], ["energy", 21.822916], ["is", 22.239583], ["dissipated", 22.382833], ["to", 22.95575], ["the", 23.085958], ["surroundings", 23.177083], ["because", 23.828125], ["of", 24.140625], ["friction", 24.244791], ["and", 24.6745], ["other", 24.84375], ["losses.", 25.065125]], "raw": [{"text": "Let", "start